  "facts": [
    "Both slice IPs explicitly configured NUM_SLR_CROSSINGS=2 / C_NUM_SLR_CROSSINGS=2, not a claimed single-crossing default.",
    "Both 512-bit AXI data width, REG15 across AW/AR/W/R/B, autopipeline0, master/slave/middle pipelines1.",
    "Native placed non-SLICE FFs prove actual LAGUNA at SLR1/2 for d0 and SLR1/0 for d1; configured crossing count is not independently a measured geometric traversal count.",
    "Generated slice clocks XDC carries async CLR false-path exception. Existing project custom DDR XDC adds no LOC/pblock; this is bounded source review, not a complete proof that placed design has no fixed locations.",
    "Moving SmartConnect alone while keeping multi-SLR slice topology does not guarantee bypass or local routes. Pure-placement vs slice-reconfiguration experiments must be separated."
  ]
